ORGANIZER CODE READ OR TARGETED-GREPPED: src/app/organizer/layout.tsx; page.tsx; payouts/page.tsx (read in full); series/page.tsx; series/[id]/manage/page.tsx; series/create/page.tsx; tournaments/page.tsx; tournaments/[id]/manage/page.tsx (extensive region reads at 730-748, 1040-1080, 2380-2480, 2500-2600, 3040-3080, 3180-3200, 3380-3600, 3624-3640 plus a whole-file Vietnamese-literal grep); tournaments/create/{QuickTournamentCreate, SmartAiTournamentModal, components/TournamentDraftDetails}.tsx. In manage/components/: BasicInfoTab, BracketSetupModal, BracketTab, ConfigTab, CourtCameraBoard, CourtScheduleBoard (region reads at 509-548 and 4624-4703 plus full-file literal grep), CourtSetup, CourtWorkspace, CreateDivisionModal, CreateVenueModal, EditVenueModal, DivisionConstraintsSection, DivisionGroupStageSettings, DivisionIdentitySection, DivisionRoundRulesSection, DivisionStrictRulesSection, FinanceTab, LivestreamTab, ManageWideOverlay, MockDataModal, OperationsWorkspace, PairingParticipantsModal, PermissionsTab, QuickSchedulePanel, RefereesTab, RegistrationFormBuilder, RegistrationSettingsCard, RegistrationTab, ScheduleGridView, ScheduleTab, SponsorSettingsPanel, TournamentManageOverview, TournamentManageSidebar, TournamentNextActionCard, TournamentQuickManagePanel, TournamentSettingsTab, TournamentStepper, useManageState, VenueCourtsModal, bracket-setup-view-model, and roster-import/{RosterColumnMappingStep, RosterPreviewTable, RosterImportModal, useRosterImportDraft}. Also grepped ops/components/{OperationsWorkspace, OpsMatches, OpsStatusOverview, ScoringPanel} and src/utils/format.ts.

METHOD NOTES / HONEST LIMITS: This was a read-only static audit — I did not run the app, switch locales, or execute any build/lint/test. Hard-coded-string counts are counts of *source lines containing a Vietnamese diacritic in non-comment code*, from a regex that excludes lines that start a `//` or `/*` comment; they are LOWER BOUNDS because the pattern also drops any line containing a `/` before the Vietnamese text, and they include a few non-user-facing data-matching strings (`useManageState.ts:391-400`, `manage/page.tsx:209`, `CourtScheduleBoard.tsx:574/588/607/651`) that are slug comparisons rather than copy. Treat the counts as an order-of-magnitude signal, not an exact figure.

NOT FULLY READ (grepped only, not line-by-line verified): manage/components/LivestreamTab.tsx, RegistrationFormBuilder.tsx, RegistrationSettingsCard.tsx, PairingParticipantsModal.tsx, RefereesTab.tsx, PermissionsTab.tsx, FootballRegistrationGroups.tsx, SeedingManagerCard.tsx, WildcardManagerCard.tsx, TournamentStepper.tsx, TournamentNextActionCard.tsx, TournamentQuickManagePanel.tsx, TournamentManageOverview.tsx, ConfigTab.tsx, WildcardManagerCard.tsx, and all of src/app/organizer/ops/components/*. These may contain additional hard-coded literals I did not tabulate; my per-file counts are complete only for the files listed as read above. The i18n key-completeness conclusion is based on the ~150 keys I enumerated above, not an exhaustive extraction of every t()/translate() call in the tree.", "clean": ["layout.tsx `lang` attribute — CORRECT. src/app/layout.tsx:140 `<html lang={locale} className={\`h-full antialiased ${inter.variable}\`} suppressHydrationWarning>` where line 89 is `const locale = await getLocale();`. getLocale() resolves through src/i18n/request.ts:6-11 from the NEXT_LOCALE cookie, which is the same value used to pick the messages bundle on line 12, so the announced language can never disagree with the rendered content.", "No `dir` attribute on `<html>` — CORRECT, both shipped locales (vi, en) are LTR, so the HTML default of ltr is right and adding one would be noise.", "Viewport meta / pinch-zoom — NOT BLOCKED. A repo-wide grep of web/ for `user-scalable|maximum-scale|export const viewport` returns ZERO matches, so there is no `export const viewport` override anywhere and Next.js emits its default `width=device-width, initial-scale=1`. Browser zoom to 400% and pinch-zoom both remain available.", "Translation key completeness, SAMPLED SET (~150 keys) — no missing key found in either locale. Verified present in BOTH messages/vi.json and messages/en.json: OrganizerTournaments.{loginRequiredTitle, loginRequiredDesc, loginAction, roleOrganizerNotAssignedTitle, roleOrganizerNotAssignedDesc, backToHomeAction, verificationBannerTitle, roleOrganizerVerifyEmailFirstDesc, upgradeToOrganizerAction, formatSinglesWomen…formatMixedDoubles, participantCount, notScheduled}; OrganizerPayouts.{selectTournament, minimumAmount, bankNameRequired, bankAccountRequired, accountHolderRequired, accessDenied, submitSuccess, loadingHistory, pageTitle, pageDescription, requestWithdrawal, balanceHint, cancel, submitting, submit, requestCount, empty, unknownTournament, status, historyTitle}; SeriesCreate.{nameRequiredError, createSuccess, createError, backToList, pageTitle, pageDescription, generalInfo, nameLabel, namePlaceholder, descriptionLabel, descriptionPlaceholder, startDateLabel, endDateLabel, prizeLabel, prizePlaceholder, bannerLabel, bannerPlaceholder, logoLabel, logoPlaceholder, defaultRulesDescription}; SeriesList.{loadError, active, completed, title, description, createAction, emptyTitle, emptyHint, createFirstAction, noDescription, legCount, notScheduled}; OrganizerSeriesManage.{loadError, defaultLegName, legNameRequired, updateLegSuccess, createLegSuccess, legActionError, deleteLegConfirm, deleteLegSuccess, deleteLegError, createLegFirst, noAvailableTournaments, validSelectionRequired, linkSuccess, linkError, unlinkConfirm, unlinkSuccess, unlinkError, loadingSeries, backToSeries, manageSeriesBadge}; OrganizerOps.viewTournamentPage; Common.{loading, cancel, statusDraft, statusCancelled, configurationOverview}; OrganizerManage.{divisions.title/description/add/addTitle/maxLimitTitle/editTitle, lockModal.free/courtFeePerPlayer/perPerson/feeRule/totalCourtFee, createDivision.* (editTitle, addTitle, typeLabel, nameShort, namePlaceholder, participantLimitShort, maxCount, eloLimitShort, minElo, maxElo, noLimit, entryFeeOverrideShort, entryFeeOverrideHint, entryFeeOverridePlaceholder, rulesSummary, liteLabel, standardLabel, stage1Short, stage2Short, configuredTeams, advanceSummary, quickSuggestion, applySuggestion, singleElimination, doubleElimination), matchSchedule.court/saving/title, courtSetupTitle, courtSetupHint, createVenueFirst, courtName, courtNamePlaceholder, venueNotSet, allStages, allLegs, allRounds, chooseCourts, selectedCourtsHint, selectedCourtCount, clearAllCourts, selectAllCourts, applyCourtSelection, savedVenueTitle, savedVenueHint, savedVenuePlaceholder, attachSavedVenue, attachingSavedVenue, scorePreview, scoreEdit, scoreBoardEmpty, scoreBoardSet, finalRound, semiFinalRound, quarterFinalRound, roundOf, toast.*, nextAction.*, wideSections.navigationLabel}; TournamentDetail.{liteShortDesc, strictShortDesc, numberOfGroups, groupStageRounds, teamsPerGroup, teamsAdvancing, playoffFormat, singleElimination, doubleElimination, seedingType, seededByElo, randomSeeding, singleEliminationFormat, doubleEliminationFormat, roundRobinFormat, groupStagePlayoffFormat, cannotChangeFormat, registrationLimit, roundRobinWarning}; OrganizerLivestream.{ready, waitingSignal, live}; OrganizerBasicInfo.{hideBannerText, hideBannerTextDescription, logoPreview, removeImage, bannerPreview}.", "Dictionary parity between locales — no drift. vi.json and en.json have identical top-level namespace order and identical per-namespace block sizes: OrganizerManage is 511 lines in both (vi 8133-8643, en 8129-8639), OrganizerQuickCreate 200 in both, OrganizerTournamentStepper 69 in both, ClubMatchSession 245 in both, the only offset being a constant 4-line shift introduced at the SeriesCreate/SeriesList/Profile region. Every key therefore exists in both locales.", "Interpolation variable names — all sampled keys match the values the component passes. en.json:8422 `configuredTeams: "{count} teams"` vs DivisionGroupStageSettings.tsx:59 `{ count: numGroups * teamsPerGroup }`; en.json:8423 `advanceSummary: "{groups} groups · top {advancing} → {total} teams"` vs line 102 `{ groups: numGroups, advancing: teamsAdvancing, total: advancingTotal }`; en.json:8424 `quickSuggestion: "Suggested: {groups} groups · {teams} teams/group · top {advancing}"` vs line 105; en.json:8592 `scoreBoardSet: "S{n}"` vs CourtScheduleBoard.tsx:5934 `{ n: setIndex + 1 }`; en.json:8507 `selectedCourtCount: "{count} courts selected"` vs CourtWorkspace.tsx:458; OrganizerSeriesManage `defaultLegName: "Leg {count}"` vs series/[id]/manage/page.tsx:104; OrganizerPayouts `requestCount: "{count} requests"` vs payouts/page.tsx:268. No `{{name}}`-style or `{name}` token mismatch found.", "ICU plural is implemented correctly where it exists, in both locales: en.json:1973 `SeriesList.legCount: "{count, plural, =0 {No legs} other {{count} legs}}"` and vi.json:2848 `"{count, plural, =0 {Chưa có chặng} other {{count} chặng}}"`. (Other count-bearing keys are the ones flagged as finding #11.)", "Locale-aware number/date formatting is done correctly in most organizer surfaces: FinanceTab.tsx:50-51 derives `numberLocale` from `useLocale()` and uses it at :82, :108, :181, :227, :257, :265, :275; RegistrationTab.tsx:1007, :1188, :1193 use `locale === 'vi' ? 'vi-VN' : 'en-US'`; manage/page.tsx:3050, :3056, :3072 do the same; series/page.tsx:135 `toLocaleDateString(locale === 'vi' ? 'vi-VN' : 'en-US')`; series/[id]/manage/page.tsx:311 `toLocaleDateString(locale)`; tournaments/page.tsx:699 `new Intl.DateTimeFormat(locale)`; CourtCameraBoard.tsx:409-410 `const dateLocale = locale === "vi" ? "vi-VN" : "en-US";` then :189 `date.toLocaleTimeString(locale, {hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'})`; TournamentDraftDetails.tsx:40 `new Intl.DateTimeFormat(locale, {dateStyle:'medium',timeZone:'UTC'})`; CourtScheduleBoard.tsx:530-538 `formatDateLabel(value, locale)`.", "Mobile sidebar does not drop functionality: TournamentManageSidebar.tsx:324-334 renders an explicit `lg:hidden` menu trigger with `aria-label={t('sidebar.openMenu')}` plus a scrim `<button aria-label={t('sidebar.closeMenu')} />`, and 336-350 gives the `<aside>` an `aria-label`, a mobile close button, and `w-[min(88vw,300px)]`; the fixed `lg:w-[250px]` only applies from the lg breakpoint.", "Breakpoint variants relocate rather than remove: manage/page.tsx:2461-2464 and 2844-2847 render `renderMetadataCard()` and `renderContactCard()` in the `block lg:hidden` mobile containers, and the same two components render again in the `hidden lg:block` desktop container at 2850-2854 — so the `hidden`/`block` split duplicates content instead of dropping it. The loading skeletons at 706-707 and 753-754 likewise have both variants.", "Main schedule board scroll region is correctly exposed: CourtScheduleBoard.tsx:4683-4685 sets `role="region"`, `aria-label={t('matchSchedule.court')}` and `tabIndex={0}` on the `overflow-x-auto overflow-y-auto` container, and line 4688 uses `min-w-[900px]` inside it — this is the pattern the other scroll containers should copy.", "Scroll containers that do meet the keyboard bar (they contain focusable children): BasicInfoTab.tsx:205 tab strip (`<button>` children), TournamentSettingsTab.tsx:124 sub-tab strip (`<button>` children), VenueCourtsModal.tsx:136 venue tab strip (`<button>` children at 140 and 166), RosterPreviewTable.tsx:38 (`<input>` children at 75 and 94).", "Reflow-friendly modal sizing (viewport units, no fixed px width): ManageWideOverlay.tsx:104-105 uses `fixed left-0! top-0! bottom-0! right-0! … max-w-none` when fullscreen and `max-w-screen-2xl w-[90vw] h-[96vh] max-h-[96vh]` otherwise; BracketSetupModal.tsx:400 and roster-import/RosterImportModal.tsx:412 use `w-[96vw] max-h-[94vh]`; CreateVenueModal.tsx:154, EditVenueModal.tsx:113 and MockDataModal.tsx:51 use `w-full max-w-lg` / `max-w-lg`. None pin a pixel width that would overflow a 320px viewport.", "Localized hover-icon hiding is decorative only, not a dropped affordance: manage/page.tsx:1072, 1117, 1133, 1150 hide `<Pencil>` / arrow glyphs with `opacity-0 group-hover/row:opacity-100`, but the enclosing row is itself the clickable control (title at 1058, 1104, 1127, 1142), so no functionality is lost. Similarly CourtScheduleBoard.tsx:4560 and 4569 use `hidden